# Final standings

The same score log gives a plain board (this slide), an animated replay and a video-synced board.

::: wrap scoreboard.Board title="Finals, Game 3" start=end
teams: Alpha, Bravo, Charlie, Delta
0:10 Alpha +3
0:20 Bravo +5
0:30 Charlie +4
0:40 Alpha +4
0:50 Delta =9
1:00 Bravo +2
:::

---

## Replay the game

Press Play, step with the arrows, or press Next to show one update at a time.

::: wrap scoreboard.Board title="Finals, Game 3" keys=true speed=2
teams: Alpha, Bravo, Charlie, Delta
0:10 Alpha +3
0:20 Bravo +5
0:30 Charlie +4
0:40 Alpha +4
0:50 Delta =9
1:00 Bravo +2
:::

---

## With the real game

Put the recording in an `assets` folder next to this file as `game.mp4`. Pause or scrub the video and the numbers follow.
Use `offset=` if the log's 0:00 is later in the video.

::: wrap scoreboard.Board video=assets/game.mp4 offset=0
teams: Alpha, Bravo, Charlie, Delta
0:10 Alpha +3
0:20 Bravo +5
0:30 Charlie +4
0:40 Alpha +4
0:50 Delta =9
1:00 Bravo +2
:::
